(Jason Schwartzman). \\nFeeling isolated in a royal court rife with scandal and intrigue, Marie Antoinette defied both royalty and commoner by living like a rock star, which served only to seal her fate.\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"organizer\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MASSIVE\",\"url\":\"https://massive.cinematik.app/\"},\"startDate\":\"2026-11-13\",\"endDate\":\"2026-12-29\",\"identifier\":\"https://www.cinematik.app/events/marie-antoinette\",\"image\":\"https://www.cinematik.app/rails/active_storage/blobs/proxy/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsiZGF0YSI6IjkyZWIyNDg2LTEyZWEtNDhkOC1iZGQ0LWNkZmFhZmU2NjNkMiIsInB1ciI6ImJsb2JfaWQifX0=--ea0820dde54e3bd6f696055972c98e99f6c1b614/MA1200x1800.png\",\"workPresented\":{\"@type\":\"Movie\",\"name\":\"Marie Antoinette (20th Anniversary 4K Restoration)\",\"director\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Sofia Coppola\"},\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv\\u003eWritten and directed by Academy Award® winner Sofia Coppola, Marie Antoinette is an electrifying yet intimate re-telling of the turbulent life of one of history's most infamous figures. Kirsten Dunst portrays the ill-fated child princess who married France's young and indifferent King Louis XVI (Jason Schwartzman).\\u0026nbsp;\\u003cbr\\u003eFeeling isolated in a royal court rife with scandal and intrigue, Marie Antoinette defied both royalty and commoner by living like a rock star, which served only to seal her fate.\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"actors\":[{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Kirsten Dunst\"},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Jason Schwartzman\"},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Steve Coogan\"},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Judy Davis\"},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Rip Torn\"},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Asia Argento\"},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Molly Shannon\"},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Shirley Henderson\"},{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"n